    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play <strong>Elie</strong> who's 16 years old. A teenager with no story, curious, a bit of a dreamer, a fan of video games and board games. He loves spending his afternoons playing role-playing games with his two best friends, <strong>Gab</strong> and <strong>Medie</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He lives in Sector G with his mother and little sister. His little sister can be a bit of a handful, but at this age, that's only to be expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world around Elie seems ordinary. People go to work, deal with their daily worries... In short, everything is normal. Until one day <strong>someone contacts you</strong>. A strange person who tells you one thing: \u201c<strong><i>you're the only one who can change the course of things</i></strong><i>\u201d</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <strong>why you</strong>? And above all... <strong>are you ready to trust them?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/b7201541d0f2bc159350120b0067ba33.poster.avif?t=1753684317\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/b7201541d0f2bc159350120b0067ba33.webm?t=1753684317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/b7201541d0f2bc159350120b0067ba33.mp4?t=1753684317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pluralys is a world that is both familiar and profoundly strange. There, you will encounter <strong>beings from elsewhere</strong>, living among humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do we still have to find out about them? Do they intend to settle on your planet forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/9134d40217e66bb2b8a43dbcb95f5154.poster.avif?t=1753684317\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/9134d40217e66bb2b8a43dbcb95f5154.webm?t=1753684317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/9134d40217e66bb2b8a43dbcb95f5154.mp4?t=1753684317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this adventure, you'll never really be alone. Your links with <strong>Gab, Medie</strong> and other characters will be at the heart of the story. Support them, talk to them...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/de8654cea62d971c5b488091f7c140c2.poster.avif?t=1753684317\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/de8654cea62d971c5b488091f7c140c2.webm?t=1753684317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/de8654cea62d971c5b488091f7c140c2.mp4?t=1753684317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been entrusted with <strong>a mysterious object</strong>. Thanks to it, you'll be able to see and interact with the world in a whole new way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/9b64c52ebc2e4dff82a7b326c4d9f069.poster.avif?t=1753684317\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/9b64c52ebc2e4dff82a7b326c4d9f069.webm?t=1753684317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/9b64c52ebc2e4dff82a7b326c4d9f069.mp4?t=1753684317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone in Pluralys has something to say. But you'll have to make some important decisions, because <strong>the choices are all yours</strong>! Be curious and discover the people who live in this world. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play <strong>Elie</strong> who's 16 years old. A teenager with no story, curious, a bit of a dreamer, a fan of video games and board games. He loves spending his afternoons playing role-playing games with his two best friends, <strong>Gab</strong> and <strong>Medie</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He lives in Sector G with his mother and little sister. His little sister can be a bit of a handful, but at this age, that's only to be expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world around Elie seems ordinary. People go to work, deal with their daily worries... In short, everything is normal. Until one day <strong>someone contacts you</strong>. A strange person who tells you one thing: \u201c<strong><i>you're the only one who can change the course of things</i></strong><i>\u201d</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <strong>why you</strong>? And above all... <strong>are you ready to trust them?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/b7201541d0f2bc159350120b0067ba33.poster.avif?t=1753684317\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/b7201541d0f2bc159350120b0067ba33.webm?t=1753684317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/b7201541d0f2bc159350120b0067ba33.mp4?t=1753684317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pluralys is a world that is both familiar and profoundly strange. There, you will encounter <strong>beings from elsewhere</strong>, living among humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do we still have to find out about them? Do they intend to settle on your planet forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/9134d40217e66bb2b8a43dbcb95f5154.poster.avif?t=1753684317\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/9134d40217e66bb2b8a43dbcb95f5154.webm?t=1753684317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/9134d40217e66bb2b8a43dbcb95f5154.mp4?t=1753684317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this adventure, you'll never really be alone. Your links with <strong>Gab, Medie</strong> and other characters will be at the heart of the story. Support them, talk to them...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/de8654cea62d971c5b488091f7c140c2.poster.avif?t=1753684317\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/de8654cea62d971c5b488091f7c140c2.webm?t=1753684317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/de8654cea62d971c5b488091f7c140c2.mp4?t=1753684317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been entrusted with <strong>a mysterious object</strong>. Thanks to it, you'll be able to see and interact with the world in a whole new way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/9b64c52ebc2e4dff82a7b326c4d9f069.poster.avif?t=1753684317\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/9b64c52ebc2e4dff82a7b326c4d9f069.webm?t=1753684317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/9b64c52ebc2e4dff82a7b326c4d9f069.mp4?t=1753684317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone in Pluralys has something to say. But you'll have to make some important decisions, because <strong>the choices are all yours</strong>! Be curious and discover the people who live in this world. </p>",
    "short_description": "Pluralys is an RPG focused on comedy, exploration, and intrigue. You play Elie, a young person living a peaceful life\u2014until unexpected visitors arrive and change everything. What seems like a quiet, cozy story hides deeper mysteries to uncover and secret plots waiting to be exposed.",
